    },
    "b-00-overview-server-jobs-are-debuggab-15": {
      "id": "b-00-overview-server-jobs-are-debuggab-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Server jobs are debuggable entrypoints over phase-owned workflow code. They do\nnot own business logic separately from the server app; running work stays under\nthe running phase, PR handoff work stays under the PR phase, shared knowledge\nand validation helpers stay under "
        },
        {
          "insert": "core",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", and raw IO adapters stay under\n"
        },
        {
          "insert": "infrastructure",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-00-overview-project-resolution-is-a-16": {
      "id": "b-00-overview-project-resolution-is-a-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Project resolution is a core project-registry concern. Jobs consume\n"
        },
        {
          "insert": "globals.repoRoot",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "globals.stateDir",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", optional "
        },
        {
          "insert": "globals.graphDbPath",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", and\noptional project metadata from "
        },
        {
          "insert": "runtime-options.ts",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-00-overview-the-run-loop-is-delibera-17": {
      "id": "b-00-overview-the-run-loop-is-delibera-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The run loop is deliberately not a Pi agent. It is a thin evented loop over\ndurable SQLite state: handle unhandled events with deterministic scheduler\nticks, start worker sessions for open slots, then rest until state changes. The\nbabysit job wraps the decomp system process, records guardian artifacts, runs\nclaim recovery when appropriate, and restarts the child when policy allows."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    }
  }
}
